[Software Title]
US=Realtek Local Area Network (LAN) Driver

[US.Software Description]
This package provides the Realtek Local Area Network (LAN) Driver that enables the Realtek Network Interface Card (NIC) Chip in supported computer models that are running a supported operating system.

